---
import BlogPostLayout from '../../layouts/BlogPostLayout.astro';
import PhotoGrid from '../../components/PhotoGrid.astro';

const imgBase = '/images/blog/japan-2018';
---

<BlogPostLayout
  title="Japan 日本"
  subtitle="April 四月"
  year={2018}
  description="My childhood dream trip to Japan — Tokyo and Osaka in April 2018."
  coverImage={`${imgBase}/IMG_6298-min.JPG`}
>

  <h2>Tokyo 東京</h2>

  <p>
    It had always been my childhood dream to go to Japan. My parents would always tease or hint at bringing me one
    day. Even after all these years, I've still wanted to go there so much. When the plane pulled just into sight of the Tokyo coastline
    I looked out of the window and at the sunrise.
    The rising sun of the Japanese flag was so much more breath taking than I had ever imagined. Photos do not do
    this view justice. (And definately not the one I took below haha)
  </p>

  <PhotoGrid>
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_6086.JPG`} alt="Tokyo sunrise from the plane" class="full" loading="lazy" />
  </PhotoGrid>

  <PhotoGrid>
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_6113-min.JPG`} alt="Tokyo" loading="lazy" />
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_6104-min.JPG`} alt="Tokyo" loading="lazy" />
  </PhotoGrid>

  <PhotoGrid>
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_6135-min.JPG`} alt="Tokyo" class="full" loading="lazy" />
  </PhotoGrid>

  <p>
    My first two meals were these two delicious ramen dishes. About 400 and 600 yen respectively. ($5.00 & $8.00)
  </p>

  <PhotoGrid>
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_6117-min.JPG`} alt="Ramen dish" loading="lazy" />
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_6126-min.JPG`} alt="Ramen dish" loading="lazy" />
  </PhotoGrid>

  <p>
    Tokyo was just where I met up with my parents flying in from overseas. We went straight to Osaka the next day.
  </p>

  <h2>Osaka 大阪市</h2>

  <p>
    Osaka was just an unreal blend of city night life fantastic eateries and traditional architecture. We spent a
    good 3 days here.
  </p>

  <PhotoGrid>
    <img src={`${imgBase}/osaka-hotel.jpg`} alt="Osaka hotel view" class="full" loading="lazy" />
  </PhotoGrid>

  <PhotoGrid>
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_8801-min.JPG`} alt="Osaka" loading="lazy" />
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_2406-min.JPG`} alt="Osaka" loading="lazy" />
  </PhotoGrid>

  <PhotoGrid>
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_1207-min.JPG`} alt="Osaka" loading="lazy" />
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_4341-min.JPG`} alt="Osaka" loading="lazy" />
  </PhotoGrid>

  <PhotoGrid>
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_5452-min.JPG`} alt="Osaka" loading="lazy" />
    <img src={`${imgBase}/IMG_9048-min.JPG`} alt="Osaka" loading="lazy" />
  </PhotoGrid>

</BlogPostLayout>
